imes.com/markets/us-stocks/wall-street-guide/ai-stocks-rebound-as-coreweave-jumps-on-goldman-upgrade/articleshow/135052127.cms", "source": "Economic Times markets", "scale": "minor", "category": "other", "region": "US", "c": 0.124, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "6d013e385491", "ts": "2026-10-15T01:30:00Z", "title": "Asian AI stocks crash: Kospi plunges about 8% triggering circuit breaker, Nikkei down about 5%", "summary": "After the hot US CPI, Korea's Kospi fell as much as 8.2% to 5,514.96, triggering a 20-minute circuit breaker (its 10th this year), while the Nikkei fell about 5% as AI and chip stocks tumbled amid AI financing worries including CoreWeave debt concerns.", "url": "https://upstox.com/news/market-news/trading/asian-stock-markets-crash-kospi-plunges-8-nikkei-drops-3400-points-amid-selloff-in-ai-related-stocks/article-201881/", "source": "Upstox / Reuters", "scale": "major", "category": "tech", "region": "Asia", "c": -0.101, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "2ee0f4e74673", "ts": "2026-10-19T06:33:50Z", "title": "GMO Internet to spend \u00a526.1 billion on up to 116 Nvidia B300 servers", "summary": "Japan's GMO Internet plans to spend \u00a526.1 billion on up to 116 Nvidia B300 servers.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9810920/GMO-Internet-to-spend-261B-on-up-to-116-NVIDIA-B300-servers-NVDA.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice", "scale": "minor", "category": "tech", "region": "Japan", "c": 0.084, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "ef5bab723941", "ts": "2026-10-19T02:33:05Z", "title": "China Q3 GDP grows 4.5%, beating forecasts; September retail sales up 1.1%", "summary": "China's GDP grew 4.5% y/y in Q3 (poll 4.4%, Q2 4.3%) and 1.2% q/q; September retail sales rose 1.1% (poll 0.5%) and industrial output 5.5%, while Jan-Sep fixed-asset investment fell 7.2% and property investment 20.6%.", "url": "https://investinglive.com/news/china-q3-gdp-beats-forecasts-at-4-5-retail-sales-grow-at-fastest-pace-since-march/", "source": "investingLive", "scale": "notable", "category": "macro-data", "region": "China", "c": 0.075, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "8f496b4abc9a", "ts": "2026-10-15T05:35:00Z", "title": "TSMC Q3 net profit jumps 69% to record T$763.1 billion, beating estimates", "summary": "TSMC reported July-September net profit of T$763.1 billion, up about 69% year on year and above the T$746.3 billion LSEG SmartEstimate; revenue rose about 50% to T$1.49 trillion on AI chip demand. The result lands during a sharp global chip-stock selloff.", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/15/tsmc-third-quarter-profit-global-ai-.html", "source": "CNBC", "scale": "notable", "category": "corporate", "region": "Asia", "c": 0.067, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "6181d48d486d", "ts": "2026-10-16T08:35:00Z", "title": "China proposes adding 40 AI, biotech and solar technologies to its export control list", "summary": "China's commerce ministry proposed adding 40 technologies, including AI models, agents and computing clusters, biomedicine and photovoltaic tech, to its catalogue of technologies prohibited or restricted from export; comments are open until Nov 15 and an interim registration requirement for transfers abroad takes effect immediately.", "url": "https://www.thestandard.com.hk/finance/article/345689/China-proposes-adding-40-AI-biotech-solar-technologies-to-export-control-list", "source": "The Standard (Reuters)", "scale": "notable", "category": "trade-policy", "region": "China", "c": -0.061, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "ab4c3c4fad82", "ts": "2026-10-16T05:49:00Z", "title": "Taiwan to curb AI chip exports to China as part of US trade deal", "summary": "Bloomberg reported Taiwan will restrict exports of advanced AI chips to China under its trade deal with the US. Earlier reporting (June) said Taipei was weighing rules covering all Chinese customers and making smuggling a crime.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOSU1LakZhV2xQNHBFM0lFWU9pT1JCdGMyTXY4Q01TSjZYd3dNbWZ4Rk50ME1UQnUzVkgta3U0RFpFY0VNZGNaeXZfV25jZm9lMjBDdjVONUhlMmJKLTNwT2xw