ughly $35 billion Apollo/Blackstone chip-lease deal in June.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQWVhYcEpDM002Y1VwaUFBYktyNFdkVG9XbXZaTU44b3k4ZzZRcmdLR294VXZkMDlYLXg1d0dJbUpoMzg3RHBoNi1qcXh1eU14UjJiSmNhTXdUUFNsakJYZFBrZ1BZVV9rdmQ3bHc5b0QycjZRUHBqcENmak5LclBVNmhWYnhTaVZtQzV4bExZamxKSEtDRllrMkNObjlFd3VoU0VIQkZaS2hpQnAzeGh3dzBqdWVHZm9sVllvQ1BEdw?oc=5", "source": "Reuters (citing FT)", "scale": "minor", "category": "tech", "region": "US", "c": 0.052, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "15c307070815", "ts": "2026-10-19T16:05:07Z", "title": "The Information: DeepSeek working with Huawei on AI chip designs for next year", "summary": "The Information reported DeepSeek is working with Huawei Technologies on new AI chip designs for next year.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9811671/DeepSeek-and-Huawei-working-on-chips-for-next-year---The-Information.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice", "scale": "minor", "category": "tech", "region": "China", "c": -0.052, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "fa32322d44f3", "ts": "2026-10-19T13:04:47Z", "title": "Amazon opens AWS Trainium AI chips to all PyTorch developers", "summary": "Amazon said it is opening its Trainium AI chips to all PyTorch developers and will open-source TorchNeuron at the PyTorch conference on October 20.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9811394/Amazon-Amazon-opens-its-AWS-Trainium-AI-chips-to-all-PyTorch-developers.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice", "scale": "minor", "category": "tech", "region": "US", "c": -0.05, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "955235e0898b", "ts": "2026-10-19T12:24:34Z", "title": "Chip stocks bounce after the longest losing streak since 2008", "summary": "US semiconductor shares rebounded in premarket trade after the SOX index's longest losing streak since 2008, including a 3.83% fall on Friday.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOb3lFbFdrZ2Jfd1pXd2ZxSjUtbHpGOW9YbFFkRDdRSlJVTUd1VFJuOGtvbVNGVlJRTG05MGFqakJyMElNSHVsV1BMNU02MDBpVDZGdHBCdUpR